 单域，reviewer 要求 generalizability limitation paragraph\"\n    number_ranges:\n      remaining_max_abs_delta_pp: [2.0, 5.0]\n      constraint_precision_mean: [0.50, 0.56]\n      constraint_precision_vs_c0_r: [-0.15, 0.25]\n      gsm8k_c0_pct: [18, 35]\n      gsm8k_delta_pp: [-3.0, 3.0]\n      combined_N_all_conditions: [1300, 1500]\n      meta_analytic_delta_pp: [-0.5, 1.5]\n      oracle_gap_pp: [8.0, 9.5]\n      f2_non_discriminative_fraction: [0.70, 0.85]\n    narrative_direction: \"Capability trap framing 基本成立但需精确化。Claim 1: 'lack discriminative power' → 'lack sufficient discriminative power in tested conditions'。Claim 2: 'empirically empty' → 'no condition achieves significant gains'（承认 underpowered 条件模糊性）。Claim 3: C0 necessary condition 成立但 insufficient 证据需更多 hedging。可能需对 LLaMA-8B 一个条件补 powered replication。论文从 'definitive characterization' 退为 'systematic empirical study with provisional characterization'。仍 EMNLP competitive，contribution 偏 benchmark+diagnostic 而非 mechanism insight。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"核心 null universality 被打破或机制证据链断裂；需根本性 reframe，但数据仍支撑 EMNLP 投稿\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"exp-012 GSM8K 或剩余条件出现 Δ>+4pp 且 p<0.05，打破 'universally empty' 叙事\"\n      - \"或 F2 per-problem 分析揭示 constraint precision 双峰分布——部分问题 precision>0.7 被 low-precision 问题稀释，capability trap 非 uniform\"\n      - \"或 exp-013 ablation 在某子集上 MaxSAT > count-only（SAT solver 非完全 vacuous）\"\n      - \"exp-011 FOLIO +10pp 信号在 domain-specific 分析中非纯噪声，LLaMA-8B×FOLIO 可能是 positive operating point\"\n      - \"reviewer 认为 oracle 仅 FOLIO + powered test 仅 Qwen-14B，evidence 不足支撑 general claim\"\n    number_ranges:\n      remaining_max_abs_delta_pp: [4.0, 8.0]\n      constraint_precision_mean: [0.52, 0.62]\n      constraint_precision_vs_c0_r: [0.20, 0.45]\n      gsm8k_c0_pct: [25, 50]\n      gsm8k_delta_pp: [3.0, 8.0]\n      combined_N_all_conditions: [1300, 1600]\n      meta_analytic_delta_pp: [1.0, 3.0]\n      oracle_gap_pp: [8.0, 9.5]\n      f2_non_discriminative_fraction: [0.50, 0.70]\n    narrative_direction: \"Capability trap 不再是 universal characterization，reframe 为 condition-dependent phenomenon。Title 改：'When Do Self-Extracted Constraints Improve LLM Reasoning? Characterizing the Capability Trap'。从 pure negative 转 boundary-condition analysis。三条 claims 重构为：(a) positive boundary — 识别 capability trap 发生的 sufficient conditions (model capacity × domain formalizability × precision threshold)，(b) mechanism — oracle 仍证明 aggregation 有效性 + capability trap 解释多数失败条件，(c) diagnostic — C0 + constraint precision 联合 deployment framework（非单独 C0）。Story 更复杂但 reviewer 可能认为更 nuanced。风险：不够 clean，可能被判 incremental。对策：强调 oracle causal separation 是不变的 contribution，boundary analysis 是 bonus。仍冲 EMNLP main，不降级。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19930,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19930},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3895088c-8f70-4561-87e7-5185b6e929c1","uuid":"efc8295a-8980-42c6-af03-00b2ec65ea48"}
